 "warnings": "the S2b build adds two compiler warnings (Swift 5 mode): Flat (a ManagedBuffer) declares @unchecked Sendable over an unavailable conformance, and OriginalStateRecord's `flat` is not Sendable in Swift 6 terms; Flat is written only while uniquely referenced and its cache is under a lock",
